Pelje, let's go!

00:01:37.680 --> 00:01:41.790
As the battle with the sheriff's soldiers grew increasingly difficult,

00:01:41.790 --> 00:01:49.920
Skalle-Per urged Mattis to make up with Borka and join together as one band of robbers.

00:01:50.740 --> 00:01:55.570
One strong chief for one strong gang of robbers.

00:01:56.420 --> 00:02:00.790
Mattis and Borka decided to face off in

00:02:00.790 --> 00:02:04.210
a Wild Beast's Match to decide which of them was suited to be chief.

00:02:08.130 --> 00:02:13.550
One Strong Band of Robbers

00:02:08.130 --> 00:02:13.550
One Strong Band of Robbers

00:02:29.420 --> 00:02:31.610
I want to see, too!

00:02:36.450 --> 00:02:39.910
Hey, now. Don't say silly things like,

00:02:39.910 --> 00:02:42.510
"This fight's already over!"

00:02:42.510 --> 00:02:43.750
Borka-chan.

00:02:49.840 --> 00:02:51.430
Way to go, Borka!

00:02:51.430 --> 00:02:53.340
Beat him up!

00:02:55.190 --> 00:03:01.390
I can't believe I'd forgotten how huge you've grown.

00:03:01.390 --> 00:03:04.270
Mattis-chan, the cry-baby shrimp.

00:03:04.270 --> 00:03:06.940
Stand up! Stand up, dammit!

00:03:06.940 --> 00:03:09.360
Sock him another one!

00:03:09.870 --> 00:03:10.820
You...

00:03:16.660 --> 00:03:19.640
Yeah! Keep it up! This is so exhilarating!

00:03:19.640 --> 00:03:20.860
Go, go!

00:03:20.860 --> 00:03:23.190
This is getting exciting!

00:03:23.190 --> 00:03:24.370
Hey, hey!

00:03:28.430 --> 00:03:29.580
L-Let me go!

00:03:29.580 --> 00:03:30.670
Let me go!

00:03:56.990 --> 00:03:58.320
Borka!

00:03:59.320 --> 00:04:00.600
Stand up, Borka!

00:04:00.600 --> 00:04:03.310
Hey, what are you doing? Get up!

00:04:03.310 --> 00:04:04.160
Go now!

00:04:04.760 --> 00:04:05.750
Crap...

00:04:09.470 --> 00:04:12.670
O-Oops...

00:04:19.210 --> 00:04:21.110
Mattis, get it together!

00:04:21.110 --> 00:04:22.140
Bring some water!

00:04:22.140 --> 00:04:22.850
Okay!

00:04:23.100 --> 00:04:25.100
Right!

00:04:25.570 --> 00:04:27.100
Here we go!

00:04:27.600 --> 00:04:30.520
Here we go!

00:04:32.480 --> 00:04:34.740
That's it! Get up, Mattis!

00:04:34.740 --> 00:04:35.860
Revenge him!

00:04:35.860 --> 00:04:38.400
Prove your manhood! Damn you!

00:04:38.400 --> 00:04:40.600
C'mon, dammit!

00:04:41.870 --> 00:04:43.750
What are you doing?

00:04:43.750 --> 00:04:45.060
Shame on you!

00:04:45.060 --> 00:04:46.370
Boo!

00:04:46.370 --> 00:04:49.020
You would be wailing if that were you!

00:04:46.370 --> 00:05:06.390
Borka! Borka!

00:04:49.020 --> 00:04:50.110
That's right!

00:04:54.300 --> 00:04:57.880
Mattis, all bark and no bite.

00:04:58.390 --> 00:05:00.710
The best chief in this forest is Borka!

00:05:00.710 --> 00:05:02.600
There is no match for him!

00:05:02.600 --> 00:05:06.390
Mattis couldn't hold a candle to him!

00:05:08.180 --> 00:05:09.640
That's right!

00:05:13.490 --> 00:05:16.710
It's a great sorrow to me...

00:05:18.400 --> 00:05:22.740
...that you're such a scoundrel.

00:05:31.160 --> 00:05:33.040
Go! Pull your neck out!

00:05:33.040 --> 00:05:35.510
Show your guts!

00:05:36.170 --> 00:05:38.590
Mattis-san! You're so great!

00:05:38.590 --> 00:05:40.420
Choke him out for good!

00:05:40.420 --> 00:05:42.100
Do it!

00:05:41.280 --> 00:05:42.760
Go! Mattis!

00:05:43.200 --> 00:05:47.810
Yeah! Now's your chance! Choke him out! Squeeze!

00:05:47.810 --> 00:05:49.660
Pull it tight!

00:05:49.660 --> 00:05:51.550
Really tight!

00:06:02.110 --> 00:06:04.260
Think they'll finally show up today?

00:06:04.260 --> 00:06:07.280
It's said they haven't been seen lately.

00:06:07.280 --> 00:06:09.760
That's too bad.

00:06:09.760 --> 00:06:11.270
"If you value your life..."

00:06:11.270 --> 00:06:12.040
Halt!

00:06:12.040 --> 00:06:13.940
What's this?

00:06:13.940 --> 00:06:15.420
Did they show up?

00:06:15.420 --> 00:06:18.120
It's a monster! Monster!

00:06:18.120 --> 00:06:20.640
You're the only monster here!

00:06:22.600 --> 00:06:24.260
Stop it now!

00:06:25.220 --> 00:06:29.470
If you play those things, that'll call them out for sure.

00:06:29.990 --> 00:06:31.680
That raucous laughter, too.

00:06:32.670 --> 00:06:34.620
Those <i>things</i>, you said?

00:06:34.620 --> 00:06:37.490
Laughter and music are the spice of life.

00:06:37.490 --> 00:06:40.230
Just like Aristotle wrote in his Theory of Comedy.

00:06:40.230 --> 00:06:41.230
Uh-huh.

00:06:41.230 --> 00:06:43.950
Can't you guys hear that?

00:06:43.950 --> 00:06:47.240
The voices of fierce robbers...

00:06:50.150 --> 00:06:52.660
That's no human's voice.

00:06:53.950 --> 00:06:57.540
On a day like today, people shouldn't pass along this road.

00:06:58.750 --> 00:07:01.230
I think you'd better turn back.

00:07:18.770 --> 00:07:22.280
Do your best, chief!

00:07:22.280 --> 00:07:24.210
Don't lose!

00:07:25.780 --> 00:07:27.820
Pay him back!

00:07:27.820 --> 00:07:30.990
Mattis! That stupid...

00:07:32.450 --> 00:07:35.780
Almost there! Mattis!

00:07:38.790 --> 00:07:41.800
Kiss my ass!

00:07:43.860 --> 00:07:47.190
You scoundrels!

00:07:47.630 --> 00:07:48.640
Wait, wait!

00:07:49.080 --> 00:07:50.760
Back off! Back off!

00:07:50.760 --> 00:07:54.140
I'm keep telling you this isn't your fight!

00:08:02.790 --> 00:08:08.730
Your robbers aren't well-mannered at all.

00:08:10.310 --> 00:08:16.250
If you weren't such a scoundrel, I would've made you second in command

00:08:16.250 --> 00:08:20.540
of my poorly-mannered robbers.

00:08:27.760 --> 00:08:34.700
And I wouldn't have to squeeze the life out of you either!

00:08:43.190 --> 00:08:46.710
It's a great sorrow to me...

00:08:47.940 --> 00:08:52.010
...that I've got to smash in your snout!

00:08:52.980 --> 00:08:56.620
Ow-ow-ow!

00:09:00.190 --> 00:09:07.220
Because you are already as ugly as anyone could wish already.

00:09:14.540 --> 00:09:18.730
Ow-ow-ow!

00:09:18.730 --> 00:09:19.840
They'll come off!

00:09:19.840 --> 00:09:21.730
They're coming off!

00:09:28.480 --> 00:09:33.690
I'm extraordinarily sorry to batter you so badly,

00:09:33.690 --> 00:09:36.850
that every time she lays eyes on you,

00:09:38.240 --> 00:09:41.080
Undis will cry!

00:09:58.010 --> 00:10:01.130
I can't keep doing watch by myself!

00:10:02.300 --> 00:10:05.860
Chief! Wait up!

00:10:23.790 --> 00:10:28.880
How about giving up already?

00:10:29.670 --> 00:10:34.000
That's my line!

00:10:37.080 --> 00:10:38.050
Undis?

00:10:45.070 --> 00:10:46.720
You bastard!

00:10:48.190 --> 00:10:49.480
Lovis?

00:10:53.450 --> 00:10:54.650
Nice try!

00:11:00.120 --> 00:11:06.250
When it comes to tenacity, there is no man in this forest who surpasses me!

00:11:14.260 --> 00:11:16.760
Chief!

00:11:20.420 --> 00:11:22.270
Not yet.

00:11:28.780 --> 00:11:29.840
One, two, three—

00:11:29.840 --> 00:11:31.300
One, two, three—

00:11:31.300 --> 00:11:32.650
One, two, three—

00:11:38.700 --> 00:11:47.120
Don't say silly things like "It's already over!"

00:11:47.550 --> 00:11:49.440
Mattis-chan!

00:11:52.240 --> 00:11:54.350
Very well.

00:12:10.980 --> 00:12:13.860
Where did everyone go?

00:12:16.460 --> 00:12:21.650
Mattis! Mattis!

00:12:32.210 --> 00:12:33.910
Mattis!

00:12:35.830 --> 00:12:38.390
I'm coming!

00:13:27.470 --> 00:13:40.950
Mattis! Mattis! Mattis! Mattis!

00:13:36.210 --> 00:13:37.440
Borka...

00:13:53.960 --> 00:13:56.080
My brother, Borka.

00:13:56.080 --> 00:13:59.550
From now on we're brothers.

00:14:02.180 --> 00:14:07.900
You shall keep a chieftain's name and fame as long as you live,

00:14:08.990 --> 00:14:12.470
and you can carry on with your own men.

00:14:13.690 --> 00:14:16.330
But don't forget...

00:14:16.330 --> 00:14:25.100
I, Mattis, am the mightiest chieftain in all the mountains and woods.

00:14:26.430 --> 00:14:31.910
My word counts for more than yours from now on.

00:14:32.580 --> 00:14:34.160
You understand that?!

00:15:09.160 --> 00:15:14.160
Ronja, the Robber's Daughter

00:15:09.160 --> 00:15:14.160
Ronja, the Robber's Daughter

00:15:26.820 --> 00:15:28.680
I think we can get along.

00:15:28.680 --> 00:15:31.510
Let's keep being friends.

00:15:31.510 --> 00:15:32.950
Let's drink!

00:15:37.780 --> 00:15:39.880
Odd! No, wait...

00:15:42.160 --> 00:15:43.990
Cheers!

00:15:57.210 --> 00:16:02.630
Yeah, since we were kids, we were as clever as horned owls!

00:16:03.210 --> 00:16:04.580
Yeah!

00:16:06.150 --> 00:16:09.230
I chase the rats into the corner of the pigsty.

00:16:09.230 --> 00:16:13.160
Then I hold a bucket behind you...

00:16:13.160 --> 00:16:16.430
And I do like this...

00:16:17.500 --> 00:16:21.010
And he's done for! Like that!

00:16:46.830 --> 00:16:48.430
Hey, Borka.

00:16:48.430 --> 00:16:50.820
Don't be upset because things went badly for you today.

00:16:52.020 --> 00:16:55.970
Better times may come for the Borka clan.

00:16:56.540 --> 00:17:03.370
When you and I are no longer here, your son will be chief for sure.

00:17:05.460 --> 00:17:09.110
My daughter certainly does not want to be.

00:17:09.680 --> 00:17:13.640
When she says "No," she means it.

00:17:14.790 --> 00:17:18.430
She gets that from her mother.

00:17:21.880 --> 00:17:23.310
Mattis...

00:17:23.880 --> 00:17:30.430
So you think Birk wants to be a robber chieftain?

00:17:33.100 --> 00:17:35.470
Of course he does!

00:17:38.710 --> 00:17:46.550
I, Birk Borkason, hereby swear never to
 become a robber, no matter what happens.

00:18:07.710 --> 00:18:11.040
I've had to get used to it.

00:18:17.320 --> 00:18:20.350
You'll have to as well.

00:18:21.230 --> 00:18:26.930
You can't do anything with kids these days.

00:18:28.850 --> 00:18:31.470
They do as they like.

00:18:31.470 --> 00:18:34.860
As parents, we just have to get used to it.

00:18:37.770 --> 00:18:43.070
But it's... damn difficult!

00:19:02.860 --> 00:19:10.340
Even if our kids don't listen to us, let's keep this amusing life of ours.

00:19:12.690 --> 00:19:14.170
That's right.

00:19:45.500 --> 00:19:52.750
How wonderful it is to rest my ears from menfolk's boisterousness.

00:19:53.940 --> 00:19:55.900
Truly.

00:20:33.830 --> 00:20:36.900
Are you okay, Skalle-Per?

00:20:41.300 --> 00:20:50.280
It soothes my old heart that neither you nor Birk want to become robbers.

00:20:55.360 --> 00:21:00.430
It was something you could do with glee once upon a time.

00:21:01.160 --> 00:21:04.060
I won't deny that.

00:21:04.670 --> 00:21:09.470
But it's tougher now.

00:21:09.940 --> 00:21:15.440
You can be hanged before you know it.

00:21:15.440 --> 00:21:21.950
Yes, and people scream and sob when you take their belongings.

00:21:21.950 --> 00:21:24.140
I can't stand that.

00:21:29.460 --> 00:21:31.210
Ronja.

00:21:35.050 --> 00:21:39.710
My little pride and joy.

00:21:40.200 --> 00:21:47.310
Now I'm going to tell you a nice little secret.

00:22:36.820 --> 00:22:38.860
I'm in pain!

00:22:42.310 --> 00:22:46.500
And, all I can hope is,

00:22:46.940 --> 00:22:52.580
about this time, that Borka is in more pain than me.

00:22:54.040 --> 00:22:55.370
Only that!

00:22:57.650 --> 00:23:00.050
You men are...

00:23:04.520 --> 00:23:09.790
Like that, the two robbers who'd been battling each other for a long time...

00:23:09.790 --> 00:23:13.690
...became one merry band of robbers.

